  <div class="lms-grid cols-2">
    <article class="lms-card">
      <ul class="mb-0">
        <li>Provide concise architecture notes with each submission.</li>
        <li>Attach code links and deployment evidence where required.</li>
        <li>Use review comments to update your next sprint plan.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
    <article class="lms-card">
      <h4>Need Clarification?</h4>
      <p class="muted">Use support to resolve blockers before deadlines.</p>
      <a class="lms-btn primary" href="/ask"><i class="las la-life-ring"></i> Contact Support</a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include("../partials/lms-layout-end") %>
